\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Shown in the shadow is the mean configurations - in some an approximation of the limit distribution of points, and in the scatter is a random $n = 50$ sample from the distribution. We show configurations for combinations of the parameters $t = 0, 0.5, 1, 2$ from left ro right and $a = 2, 3, 5$ from top to bottom.}}{29}{figure.caption.19}%
